   why_it_matters="Formalizes overhaul TS-01, a critical finding: the pipeline's LTE consistency criterion scores 'excellent' by construction on the default route. Frontiers/12 R3 states this only in prose. A theorem lets validity.py mark the criterion not_evaluated on the sb_offset route with a cited reason.",
